### Lab 1 — Hotel Booking. Run in IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client), environment "local".
### Run the two "Get token" requests first: they save tokens into {{alice_token}} / {{bob_token}}.

### 0.1 Get token — alice (ADMIN, USER)
POST {{keycloak}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=hotel-app&username=alice&password=alice123

> {% client.global.set("alice_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 0.2 Get token — bob (USER)
POST {{keycloak}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=hotel-app&username=bob&password=bob123

> {% client.global.set("bob_token", response.body.access_token); %}


########## AC1: CRUD (hotels / rooms) ##########

### 1.1 List hotels — public (200)
GET {{app}}/api/hotels

### 1.2 Filter hotels by city — public (200)
GET {{app}}/api/hotels?city=Kyiv

### 1.3 Get hotel by id — public (200)
GET {{app}}/api/hotels/1

### 1.4 Create hotel — alice/ADMIN (201)
POST {{app}}/api/hotels
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kharkiv Plaza",
  "city": "Kharkiv",
  "address": "Sumska 1",
  "stars": 4,
  "description": "Business hotel in the centre"
}

> {% client.global.set("hotel_id", response.body.id); %}

### 1.5 Update hotel — alice/ADMIN (200)
PUT {{app}}/api/hotels/{{hotel_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kharkiv Plaza",
  "city": "Kharkiv",
  "address": "Sumska 5",
  "stars": 5,
  "description": "Renovated in 2026"
}

### 1.6 Create room in hotel — alice/ADMIN (201)
POST {{app}}/api/hotels/{{hotel_id}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "12",
  "type": "DOUBLE",
  "capacity": 2,
  "pricePerNight": 2100.00
}

> {% client.global.set("room_id", response.body.id); %}

### 1.7 List rooms of hotel — public (200)
GET {{app}}/api/hotels/{{hotel_id}}/rooms

### 1.8 Update room — alice/ADMIN (200)
PUT {{app}}/api/rooms/{{room_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "12",
  "type": "SUITE",
  "capacity": 3,
  "pricePerNight": 3500.00
}

### 1.9 Validation error (400)
POST {{app}}/api/hotels
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "city": "Kyiv",
  "address": "x",
  "stars": 9
}

### 1.10 Duplicate hotel (409)
POST {{app}}/api/hotels
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dnipro Riverside",
  "city": "Kyiv",
  "address": "x",
  "stars": 3
}

### 1.11 Delete room — alice/ADMIN (204)
DELETE {{app}}/api/rooms/{{room_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}

### 1.12 Delete hotel — alice/ADMIN (204)
DELETE {{app}}/api/hotels/{{hotel_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}

### 1.13 Deleted hotel is gone (404)
GET {{app}}/api/hotels/{{hotel_id}}


########## AC5: JWT authentication ##########

### 5.1 Protected endpoint without token (401)
GET {{app}}/api/bookings/my

### 5.2 Invalid token (401)
GET {{app}}/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer not-a-real-token

### 5.3 Valid token — no session, no UI (200)
GET {{app}}/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}


########## AC6: SecurityFilterChain rules ##########

### 6.1 bob (USER) creates hotel — POST /api/hotels is ADMIN-only in the chain (403)
POST {{app}}/api/hotels
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob's Hostel",
  "city": "Kyiv",
  "address": "x",
  "stars": 1
}

### 6.2 bob (USER) deletes a room (403)
DELETE {{app}}/api/rooms/1
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}

### 6.3 bob (USER) -> /api/admin/** is ADMIN-only in the chain (403)
GET {{app}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}

### 6.4 alice (ADMIN) -> /api/admin/stats (200)
GET {{app}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}


########## Bookings flow ##########

### B.1 Search available rooms — public (200)
GET {{app}}/api/rooms/available?checkIn=2026-12-10&checkOut=2026-12-13&guests=2

### B.2 bob books room 2 for 3 nights (201, PENDING, totalPrice = 3 * 2600)
POST {{app}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 2,
  "checkIn": "2026-12-10",
  "checkOut": "2026-12-13",
  "guestsCount": 2
}

> {% client.global.set("booking_id", response.body.id); %}

### B.3 Same room, overlapping dates (409)
POST {{app}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 2,
  "checkIn": "2026-12-12",
  "checkOut": "2026-12-15",
  "guestsCount": 1
}

### B.4 Too many guests for the room (400)
POST {{app}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "checkIn": "2026-12-20",
  "checkOut": "2026-12-21",
  "guestsCount": 3
}

### B.5 bob — my bookings (200)
GET {{app}}/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}

### B.6 bob — own booking by id (200, @PostAuthorize owner check)
GET {{app}}/api/bookings/{{booking_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}


########## AC7: @PreAuthorize (chain only requires "authenticated" for /api/bookings/**) ##########

### 7.1 bob (USER) lists ALL bookings — @PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')") (403 AccessDeniedException)
GET {{app}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}

### 7.2 alice (ADMIN) lists ALL bookings (200)
GET {{app}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}

### 7.3 bob (USER) confirms booking — ADMIN only (403)
PATCH {{app}}/api/bookings/{{booking_id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}

### 7.4 alice (ADMIN) confirms booking (200, CONFIRMED)
PATCH {{app}}/api/bookings/{{booking_id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}

### 7.5 bob (USER) deletes booking — ADMIN only (403)
DELETE {{app}}/api/bookings/{{booking_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}

### 7.6 bob cancels own booking (200, CANCELLED)
PATCH {{app}}/api/bookings/{{booking_id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}

### 7.7 alice (ADMIN) deletes booking (204)
DELETE {{app}}/api/bookings/{{booking_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}


########## AC4: OIDC (open in a browser, not here) ##########
# http://localhost:8081/              -> landing page, "Увійти через Keycloak"
# http://localhost:8081/ui/index.html -> 302 to Keycloak login, back with a session
# http://localhost:8081/logout        -> logs out of the app and Keycloak

### 4.1 UI page without session -> 302 redirect to /oauth2/authorization/keycloak
GET {{app}}/ui/index.html
